note How the agent builds a path from the command line. Every one of these commands loads the map, mutates it, saves it whole and exits, and every one of them records author = AI so the owner can see what a session wrote. The shape of a flow is the agent's responsibility: path-add takes an explicit parent and warns when a step lands under something that does not call it, which is the one guard rail against a flow that does not read like a call tree.

